    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The storm is over, the park is closed, but you\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the newest Deputy Ranger your duty is to protect and maintain Phantom Trails. Hike through Lucy Falls, collect as much trash as you can, and seek the clues whoever's been leaving around for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <i>Trailblazer Edition</i>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the natural wonder of the park with your dog, Chick.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up trash and debris from the trails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the area\u2019s mysterious past through notes, letters, and informational signs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect pages of <i>Phantom Truths</i>, a local cryptozoology magazine.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The storm is over, the park is closed, but you\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the newest Deputy Ranger your duty is to protect and maintain Phantom Trails. Hike through Lucy Falls, collect as much trash as you can, and seek the clues whoever's been leaving around for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <i>Trailblazer Edition</i>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the natural wonder of the park with your dog, Chick.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up trash and debris from the trails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the area\u2019s mysterious past through notes, letters, and informational signs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect pages of <i>Phantom Truths</i>, a local cryptozoology magazine.</p></li></ul>",
